deckcheck is a diagnostic toolkit for the Steam Deck. It reads system state
(/proc, sensors) and, only with explicit user confirmation, can invoke standard
KDE/system tools (e.g. balooctl) to apply safe, reversible fixes. It bundles no
third-party source code. The optional GUI depends on PySide6 (Qt for Python),
which is distributed separately under the LGPL.
